 not mirrored to its siblings. Worst: halfwhite-chordal-stonefly ('--class requirement not propagated to MCP transition_ticket + NDJSON import') had 9 prior PASS reviews and ZERO findings. Also obnoxious-ogreish-neontetra, lemon-rabid-solenodon. Add a content-triggered surface-parity overlay: when a CLI command's args/guards/required-fields change, require the MCP tool + NDJSON/import path be updated in lockstep (or explicitly justify divergence). Advisory first.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"820d-6c54-412e-4470","ticket_type":"task","title":"Add code-review surface-parity criterion (CLI <-> MCP <-> import-format lockstep)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c3ececa5-9b6f-44b3-9438-0f218f9d2378","eab5e60c-be9a-4029-abd0-60f27e0a0859"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787076419021039959,"uuid":"b6cda28e-baa0-437a-adc7-f525e1c548f0"}